    "summary": "Adds a Project-owned native mutation controller/gateway with private exact request text, original-ticket status/replay, explicit expiry locks, independent postcommit retries and transient no-persistence state. Six real Project/socket tests use actual signed-ticket/receipt authority; actual Project teardown clears old attempts and a fresh Project only reloads current rows. Queued EDT callbacks stop with view subscriptions. Adjacent four owner cases pass.",
